{"sections":[{"slug":"局部化","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"局部化"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部化</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">环</span>)"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"局部化 (环)"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">环</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">局部化</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是使其中某些元素成为可逆元的万有的方法</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数-几何对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何侧</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">局部化将环的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/谱(代数)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">谱</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">变成原来的一个子空间</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">另见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部化(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部化</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">范畴论</span>)"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/Bousfield局部化","text":"Bousfield <span lang=\"zh\">局部化</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">稳定同伦论</span>)"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为环</span>, $S\\subset A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为子集</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">关于</span> $S$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">局部化</span></strong> $A\\to A[S^{-1}]$ <span lang=\"zh\">为满足如下条件的环同态</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对任意环同态</span> $\\varphi\\colon A \\to B$, <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $\\varphi(S)\\subset B^\\times$, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $\\varphi$ <span lang=\"zh\">将</span> $S$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素映射到</span> $B$ <span lang=\"zh\">的可逆元</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $\\varphi$ <span lang=\"zh\">唯一地穿过</span> $A\\to A[S^{-1}]$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">素理想</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathfrak p\\subset A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为素理想</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $\\mathfrak p$ <strong><span lang=\"zh\">处</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的局部化为</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">关于</span> $\\mathfrak p$ <strong><span lang=\"zh\">之外</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的元素的局部化</span>:\n$$\r\nA_{\\mathfrak p} := A [(A\\setminus\\mathfrak p)^{-1}].\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">注意此处的记号稍有混淆</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">分式计算</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">当子集</span> $S$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">乘性</span></strong> (multiplicative) <span lang=\"zh\">子集</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即关于</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的乘法封闭时</span>, $A[S^{-1}]$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素有如下具体表达式</span>:\n$$\r\nA[S^{-1}] = \\Big\\{ \\frac{a}{s} \\Bigm| a\\in A, s\\in S \\Big\\} / \\sim,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/等价关系","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">等价关系</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\sim$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>\n$$\r\n\\frac{a}{s}\\sim \\frac{a'}{s'}\\Leftrightarrow\r\n\\exists t\\in S\\, t(as'-a's) = 0.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">素理想</span></h3>\n<p>$A[S^{-1}]$ <span lang=\"zh\">的素理想等同于</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">中与</span> $S$ <span lang=\"zh\">不相交的素理想</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">例如</span>, $A_{\\mathfrak p}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的素理想等同于</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">包含于</span></strong> $\\mathfrak p$ <span lang=\"zh\">的素理想</span>. (<span lang=\"zh\">而</span> $A/\\mathfrak p$ <span lang=\"zh\">的素理想等同于</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">包含</span></strong> $\\mathfrak p$ <span lang=\"zh\">的素理想</span>.)</p>\n"}]}}}]}